          </div>
          <div class="column" style="border-color:orange;border-width:3px">
            <h3 style="color:orange">Stony Brook</h3>
            <h2 style="font-size:42px;color:orange">Transferable particle tracking</h2>
            <p class="note">with Argonne, BNL</p>
            <p style="margin-top:25px">One tracking model that works on a detector it has
