            <span class="me">W&amp;M</span> mixture-of-experts FMs for particle interactions
            &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
            <span class="me">Wisconsin</span> principles of FMs for particle and nuclear physics
            &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
            <span class="me">Hawaii</span> an FM to unify neutrinoless double beta decay searches
